{"author":{"id":"1d5f412cdeafe9987ad9876b0995bf5032718543d34c038a50cdb41808e9874c"},"ops":[{"type":5,"timestamp":1788305124,"nonce":"KCbGLVhJyZ25z6XmWLcccAjfTBg=","metadata":{"github-id":"LE_lADOULVc1M8AAAABPPhd8c8AAAAHEtKv4w"},"added":["bug"],"removed":[]},{"type":5,"timestamp":1788305125,"nonce":"jkGuWMjTGbUdeNjsxGelU196Dng=","metadata":{"github-id":"LE_lADOULVc1M8AAAABPPhd8c8AAAAHEtKwWA"},"added":["data-integrity"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"timestamp":1788307498,"nonce":"F2wtARrUjCeyPakTb0k3k+T7+C0=","metadata":{"github-id":"IC_kwDOULVc1M8AAAABR_ZriQ","github-url":"https://github.com/kanya-approve/torram-ng/issues/7#issuecomment-5502299017"},"message":"Confirmed against libtorrent's test corpus (now vendored at `tests/data/libtorrent/`). Nine of its 108 torrents decode cleanly and produce destination paths outside the chosen output directory:\n\n```\nabsolute_filename.torrent        -\u003e /foobar\nhidden_parent_path.torrent       -\u003e foo/../../../bar/bar\ninvalid_directory_name.torrent   -\u003e /foo\ninvalid_filename2.torrent        -\u003e /.\nparent_path.torrent              -\u003e ../../bar\nslash_path.torrent               -\u003e /bar\nslash_path2.torrent              -\u003e /bar\nslash_path3.torrent              -\u003e temp/../../abc\nsymlink_filtered_path.torrent    -\u003e /bar\n```\n\nTwo distinct mechanisms:\n\n- **Absolute components.** `os.path.join()` discards everything before an absolute component, so `os.path.join(output_dir, name, \"/foobar\")` evaluates to `/foobar` no matter what the user passed to `-o`.\n- **Parent traversal.** `../../bar` simply climbs out.\n\nCovered by `tests/test_corpus.py::test_declared_paths_cannot_escape_the_output_directory`, currently `xfail(strict=True)`. The invariant it asserts is that every declared path must resolve under the output root.\n\nNote `backslash_path.torrent` is deliberately excluded from that list: on POSIX a backslash is an ordinary filename character, so `\\/\\/bar` stays inside the output directory. It is an escape only on Windows.","files":null}]}